WEBVTT

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:07.770
taian biyori tenki ga ii nara kimi to

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:07.770
When it's a lucky day with nice weather

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:11.770
shigoto arimasu you ni ii koto arimasu you ni

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:11.770
I hope we have a good time together.

00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:15.620
kyou mo shan shan shan issho ni

00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:15.620
Today let's keep

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:19.270
shan shan shan waraou

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:19.270
Sharing laughs

00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:26.720
hontou no onegaigoto wa kossori kiipu shite kureru

00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:26.720
You keep my true desires secret

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:34.070
tsuitenai na tte hi no ato wa umeawase shite kureru ne

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:34.070
You always cheer me up on bad days

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:40.580
chiccha na koro kara kitto minna shitteru

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:40.580
I'm sure everyone has known it since childhood

00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:49.250
sokkenai furi shinagara itsudemo tsuyoi mikata

00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:49.250
You pretend you don't care, but you're always a good friend

00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:57.480
kamisama wa kyou mo taihen hottokenai shoubu

00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:57.480
You have another busy day as a god, with fights you must continue

00:00:57.650 --> 00:01:04.990
oisogashii ai de minna no genki wo sotto hitonade

00:00:57.650 --> 00:01:04.990
Everyone is cheered up by your radiant glowing love

00:01:05.380 --> 00:01:13.150
kamisama to itsumo issho ni yukai ni naru otetsudai

00:01:05.380 --> 00:01:13.150
You're always with me; helping you is enjoyable.

00:01:13.370 --> 00:01:20.820
daiji na egao mamorou kokoroatari aru deshou

00:01:13.370 --> 00:01:20.820
I'll protect that precious smile. You know what I mean

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.620
taian biyori tenki ga ii nara kimi to

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.620
When it's a lucky day with nice weather

00:01:24.820 --> 00:01:28.400
shan shan bouken tokidoki ikanakucha

00:01:24.820 --> 00:01:28.400
We sometimes have to depart on an adventure

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:38.990
There are numerous gods gathered in Takamagahara.

00:01:38.990 --> 00:01:44.460
They reside here with somber dignity.

00:01:51.490 --> 00:01:52.980
Mayu-sama!

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:54.750
Oh, Kuroe!

00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:57.850
All right.

00:01:59.690 --> 00:02:00.970
Let's go!

00:02:07.930 --> 00:02:10.100
Mayu-sama, you're doing great!

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:15.000
Hello.

00:02:18.980 --> 00:02:20.510
Mayu's Home

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:24.250
Not only did you extirpate your
confinement cell and attempt to abscond,

00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:26.410
but you ventured to an ignominious gambler's den as well.

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:29.140
What were you thinking, Mayu?

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:29.960
Sorry.

00:02:29.950 --> 00:02:33.960
Ama no Kura no Moriakari no Hime

00:02:29.980 --> 00:02:33.960
Mayu's Mother

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:34.180
You even exploited your divine powers for
such frivolously jejune antics. Unbelievable!

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:38.870
It seems you fail to understand why
you were grounded in the first place.

00:02:38.710 --> 00:02:38.840
Mayu's Dad

00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:41.210
Calm down, dear. Just this once—

00:02:40.670 --> 00:02:42.850
“<i>Just</i> this once”?!

00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:45.590
I mean... can you let her off again this time?

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:49.250
squirming

00:02:45.590 --> 00:02:47.880
Mayu looks sorry for what she did.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:49.250
Stare

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:54.380
The intensity of her glare is almost palpable.

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:56.480
I sincerely regret my actions, Mother.

00:02:56.630 --> 00:02:58.250
There, you see that?

00:02:58.250 --> 00:03:01.790
You are at fault for spoiling Mayu.

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:02.150
Huh?

00:03:03.690 --> 00:03:08.500
Regardless, I cannot <i>just</i> ground you this time.

00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:14.690
Therefore, I am revoking your divine powers indefinitely!

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:18.520
Until I bade for your return, you are
hereby banished from Takamagahara!

00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:19.490
No way!

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:25.590
You...

00:03:25.590 --> 00:03:27.220
will come to know the
consequences of your actions.

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:39.920
I wish I hadn't dreamt that.

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:41.660
I need some fresh air.

00:03:51.610 --> 00:03:54.180
Mayu-sama, let's have some tea!

00:03:54.180 --> 00:03:56.510
Oh, perfect timing, Yuzu!

00:04:03.480 --> 00:04:04.780
It's pouring.

00:04:04.780 --> 00:04:07.850
We call it a "spring shower";
it seems spring is almost here.

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:08.910
Yeah.

00:04:11.630 --> 00:04:13.480
It's already been four years since then.

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:19.250
Poverty Goddess Inspector

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:23.170
Though we live in the 21st century,

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:26.140
there exists myriad gods hidden from our eyes.

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:29.150
It is known as “chiyorozu yaoyorozu”.

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:29.150
TL Note: Derived from the common phrase "yaoyorozu no kami", which literally means: eight million gods.

00:04:29.150 --> 00:04:30.850
The gods of the four seasons announce each season,

00:04:30.850 --> 00:04:32.730
dog gods ward off bad luck,

00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:34.560
fox gods protect wealth,

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:36.570
et cetera, et cetera.

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:40.160
As for our Cat God...

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:40.270
Yaoyorozu-dou

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:43.650
Purchase, purchase!

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:47.040
Add in the utility bill.

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:48.370
Buy, buy!

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:52.180
Oh, and I have to pay the residence tax.

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:54.090
More and more capital!

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:58.660
I saw it coming, but these figures are hopeless.

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:04.150
Now to buy five times as much and monopolize!

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:05.960
How's that, Takayuki?!

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:11.440
Mayu-sama, I'm happy to see the
flourishing economy inside your games.

00:05:11.560 --> 00:05:17.310
Takayuki

00:05:11.780 --> 00:05:14.310
Y-Yuzu-san,

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:12.250
Doki Doki

00:05:14.310 --> 00:05:17.190
is it still recessing in reality?

00:05:18.030 --> 00:05:22.000
It is. I have no choice; I'll have to use it.

00:05:22.230 --> 00:05:23.500
What is "it"?

00:05:24.030 --> 00:05:26.410
In case of emergencies, I tucked away a nest egg.

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:33.880
I hid it so carefully that I can't find it now.

00:05:35.370 --> 00:05:37.170
You're helpless.

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:39.280
Mayu-sama?

00:05:39.620 --> 00:05:44.300
I am a cat god: a guardian of forgotten items and memories.

00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:49.690
Hark, oh nest egg Yuzu's seeks,

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:51.940
thine master commands ye!

00:05:52.860 --> 00:05:55.220
Reveal to me your location!

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:04.610
It's there.

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:05.550
Nest egg

00:06:06.850 --> 00:06:08.880
Oh, I forgot!

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:14.670
My divine powers may have been
taken away, but this is an easy job—

00:06:14.670 --> 00:06:18.020
Mayu-sama, you're awesome! Clap, clap, clap, clap!

00:06:17.150 --> 00:06:20.240
—though it's about the best I can do.

00:06:20.210 --> 00:06:21.960
Ira

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:25.180
Here we have yet another god.

00:06:26.970 --> 00:06:29.720
Total

00:06:26.970 --> 00:06:29.720
Yen

00:06:26.970 --> 00:06:27.220
Tax included 0 yen

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:29.720
Tax included 6 yen

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:29.720
Thank you for your purchase. Please come again.

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:29.730
Your total comes to 231 yen.

00:06:33.820 --> 00:06:35.790
Jeez, it's all coins.

00:06:40.180 --> 00:06:42.580
At least it's exact <i>change</i>.

00:06:46.660 --> 00:06:47.760
There you go.

00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:52.850
I want a new one!

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:53.700
Next in line, please.

00:07:02.760 --> 00:07:03.520
Ope—

00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:12.800
President's Office

00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:12.800
Irageya Supermarket

00:07:13.090 --> 00:07:16.020
Business is as booming as ever!

00:07:16.030 --> 00:07:20.210
I know I just looked at it, but I feel
like seeing my company's wealth again.

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:23.380
I don't even care that my keyboard will get sticky

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:25.150
because I'm so ridiculously wealthy I can buy another!

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:26.760
Current

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:29.730
Huh? It's below the profit margin!

00:07:33.240 --> 00:07:36.190
My my, sucks to be you.

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:38.790
Yaoyorozu-dou

00:07:39.110 --> 00:07:40.090
Mayu-sama.

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:55.760
Nest egg (cash)

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:46.810
I got excited when I found these emergency funds earlier...

00:07:46.810 --> 00:07:47.660
Yeah.

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:52.920
but if we have to resort to this, it means we have no future.

00:07:57.030 --> 00:08:00.690
L-Let's not be too pessimistic!

00:08:00.690 --> 00:08:04.420
You know how the saying goes, “Fine clothes do not make the man”?

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:09.370
Fine clothes... Fine clothes... Fine clothes...

00:08:09.370 --> 00:08:09.930
Huh?

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:11.580
Fine clothes...

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:13.080
Sasanishiki rice!

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:15.680
TL Note: The joke here is that "nishiki" (fine clothes) reminds Yuzu of food like sasanishiki rice.

00:08:13.080 --> 00:08:15.680
Our finances are that bad?!

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:17.450
It's this late already!

00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:20.820
I can't miss the morning sale at the Irageya Supermarket!

00:08:20.820 --> 00:08:23.170
Mayu-sama, please look after the house, okay?

00:08:23.170 --> 00:08:25.570
I want a sukiyaki or something.

00:08:25.570 --> 00:08:26.610
I'm off!

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:30.200
That hurt.

00:08:31.550 --> 00:08:33.030
Y-Yuzu-san?!

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:35.920
Oh, hello, Gonta-san!

00:08:35.920 --> 00:08:38.660
I'm sorry. Are you all right?

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:43.250
Yes, but it's my fault for not watching where I was going.

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:46.100
Y-Yuzu-san, it appears today's my lucky day.

00:08:46.530 --> 00:08:50.190
It's so lucky that, well, how should I put it? It's like—

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:50.190
Yuzu, don't you need to leave?

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:51.380
Oh, right!

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:55.270
Gonta-san, sorry I can't serve you tea right now,

00:08:55.270 --> 00:08:57.380
I have some errands to run; so please excuse me.

00:08:57.380 --> 00:09:01.410
It's fine! I don't mind... at all.

00:09:02.260 --> 00:09:04.880
I can make Mayu get me some tea.

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:10.450
Man, Yuzu-san is such a nice person.

00:09:08.740 --> 00:09:11.660
I'm sorry. Are you all right?

00:09:12.140 --> 00:09:14.770
So, Gonta, what's this about the tea?

00:09:14.770 --> 00:09:16.910
Hmph! Don't call me Gonta!

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:22.370
I have a legitimate name that the god Uka-no-
Mitama gave me: Oomiya-Michinushi-no-Mikoto!

00:09:23.210 --> 00:09:27.160
But you were blushing when Yuzu called you Gonta-san.

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:29.780
Trying to act tough are we, Gonta-san?

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:33.100
Well, never mind that.

00:09:33.100 --> 00:09:34.730
I'm here today because of business.

00:09:35.140 --> 00:09:36.770
Oh, that's unusual.

00:09:37.230 --> 00:09:39.170
I have some bad news.

00:09:39.170 --> 00:09:40.700
The Goddess of Poverty is on her way here!

00:09:41.330 --> 00:09:42.620
What did you say?!

00:09:43.990 --> 00:09:45.760
All right, let's go.

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:46.660
Snap!

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:53.460
Aw, the strap on my sandal broke.

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:54.110
Oh?

00:09:55.100 --> 00:09:57.010
Are you all right?

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:04.710
Thanks for drawing us so cute!

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:16.400
Where did he get all of this?

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:27.900
Due to an unprecedented emergency, I, the guardian of this town, have temporarily locked down this bridge.

00:10:28.050 --> 00:10:29.810
What's going on?

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:31.780
The Goddess of Poverty is coming to this town!

00:10:33.220 --> 00:10:34.600
From over there!

00:10:35.370 --> 00:10:37.160
However, be rest assured,

00:10:37.160 --> 00:10:44.350
my personal army will defend this town until our last breath!

00:10:44.350 --> 00:10:46.490
We'll stop the Goddess of Poverty!

00:10:46.490 --> 00:10:48.870
This is huge and it looks pretty strong.

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:50.180
Mayu-sama.

00:10:50.280 --> 00:10:52.110
S-S-Sa...

00:10:52.110 --> 00:10:53.510
It's me, Sasana,

00:10:53.510 --> 00:10:58.070
and as per our engagement; I'm here to be your wife.

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:03.770
Excuse me, I got a bit ahead of myself.

00:11:03.770 --> 00:11:07.770
Although, I <i>am</i> always ready to marry you.

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:12.280
Why am I forced to marry a girl instead of getting a husband?

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:17.800
Location: Izumo Shrine, Divine Realm:
The month all the gods are present.

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:24.930
Mayu's dad Gen

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:24.930
Sasana's dad Munetake

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:21.910
Hey, Munetake-san, long time no see!

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:24.830
Oh, Gen-san, I'm glad to see you're well.

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:28.850
Your kid looks so brave and intelligent.

00:11:29.060 --> 00:11:32.680
Well, yours is really cute and has a such coy smile.

00:11:34.090 --> 00:11:37.990
It seems like fate that they were born on the same day.

00:11:37.990 --> 00:11:39.270
Yeah, they seem to be getting along well.

00:11:39.600 --> 00:11:42.750
What do you think about them getting married in the future?

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:43.850
That sounds great!

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:47.130
Your child is so full of energy!

00:11:47.130 --> 00:11:50.350
Your child looks so confident!

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:52.780
He'll make a great husband for my child someday!

00:11:53.670 --> 00:11:59.890
That same day, they went and wrote up the engagement papers in the presence of the great god, Amaterasu.

00:11:59.890 --> 00:12:02.750
I can't believe they forgot to check our genders.

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:05.980
Mayu-sama, are you reminiscing about the past?

00:12:05.980 --> 00:12:07.120
Stop right there!

00:12:08.810 --> 00:12:10.310
Daikokuten's granddaughter

00:12:10.420 --> 00:12:11.300
Meiko!

00:12:11.300 --> 00:12:15.870
I heard about everything! There's an
impending crisis in your town, right?

00:12:15.870 --> 00:12:18.010
I rushed right over here to give you a hand!

00:12:18.010 --> 00:12:19.900
Another pain in the ass...

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:20.650
Wait!

00:12:20.650 --> 00:12:22.600
Sasana, you wait!

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:23.090
Huh?

00:12:23.090 --> 00:12:25.590
I want to reminiscence my childhood with her too.

00:12:25.590 --> 00:12:27.600
They're sworn rivals.

00:12:28.800 --> 00:12:31.760
She doesn't have any friends!

00:12:31.760 --> 00:12:35.960
I know, she's so stuck up just because her family's rich.

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:38.570
Hey, you!

00:12:39.910 --> 00:12:42.120
Come play with us!

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:42.460
What?!

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:47.840
I-I...

00:12:48.720 --> 00:12:51.210
don't engage in superfluous activities!

00:12:52.670 --> 00:12:56.470
I see, well, come find us when you want to play.

00:12:56.470 --> 00:12:57.220
See ya!

00:13:04.040 --> 00:13:07.590
A lot has happened since then, but I'll stop there!

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:08.720
You're done?

00:13:09.240 --> 00:13:14.030
Anyhow, it's my job as her fiancée to help her!

00:13:14.030 --> 00:13:16.290
Meiko, you don't need to butt in!

00:13:16.410 --> 00:13:21.170
An accidental engagement pact like that is meaningless!

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:22.160
I see.

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:27.040
Release! Mekajiki!

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:34.350
You've drawn your sword?

00:13:35.260 --> 00:13:36.560
Are you running away?

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:39.260
Isn't this better suited for fighting?

00:13:39.260 --> 00:13:40.740
Good point.

00:13:40.740 --> 00:13:44.940
I can let loose and fix that haughty attitude of yours!

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:47.040
Don't you sound all high and mighty?

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:51.300
Let's make this more interesting; how about
letting the winner have Mayu all to themselves?

00:13:52.030 --> 00:13:53.520
Th-That's...

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:56.970
Oh, are you not willing to risk it all?

00:13:57.980 --> 00:14:00.510
What are those two doing?!

00:14:00.510 --> 00:14:02.160
I have no choice.

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:07.420
They probably forgot about Gonta. I guess
I'll make him explain the situation.

00:14:07.420 --> 00:14:08.850
Hey, Gonta, pull yourself together!

00:14:18.350 --> 00:14:20.160
Both of you get down here!

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:22.380
It's an emergency!

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:23.180
Oh, that's right!

00:14:23.950 --> 00:14:26.550
Gonta, you explain the rest.

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:27.250
Yeah.

00:14:28.310 --> 00:14:33.480
It's my duty as the guardian of this town to protect it from the Goddess of Poverty.

00:14:33.480 --> 00:14:36.750
If it was some small fry who could only make the food bad,

00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:38.850
I wouldn't be making such a big fuss about it.

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:40.810
I would!

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:41.920
Sukiyaki

00:14:39.920 --> 00:14:41.920
Egg on rice

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:43.830
Unfortunately, this is a much bigger opponent.

00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:44.170
Hot steamed rice

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:44.170
Kneaded flour

00:14:44.120 --> 00:14:48.830
If she even walks <i>near</i> the stock
exchange, stock prices will plummet!

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:56.760
In fact, it's rumored that she caused the Great
Depression in America when she visited Wall Street!

00:14:58.830 --> 00:15:06.060
She might not be as terrifying as the rumors, but if the Goddess of Poverty invades now my finances will definitely be...

00:15:06.860 --> 00:15:07.740
finished.

00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:14.560
I'll be giving it my all for Mayu!

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:17.170
I'll help you as well, Mayu-sama.

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:21.550
Although, Gonta, what if the Goddess of Poverty takes a different road into town?

00:15:21.830 --> 00:15:27.010
I've got that covered. Her current location is being shown in real-time by this divine power radar!

00:15:24.210 --> 00:15:36.850
Poverty

00:15:27.010 --> 00:15:28.090
Look!

00:15:28.090 --> 00:15:29.810
What a huge divine power reading!

00:15:29.810 --> 00:15:31.260
It looks like a typhoon.

00:15:31.260 --> 00:15:33.890
Can you fix this display?

00:15:33.890 --> 00:15:37.120
Her power is covering too big of an
area; we can't pinpoint her location.

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:39.270
I think if you touch this panel—

00:15:39.270 --> 00:15:41.550
What are you doing? You brought up an irrelevant screen.

00:15:41.550 --> 00:15:42.500
Let me see!

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:43.540
This isn't working at all.

00:15:45.070 --> 00:15:46.860
Huh? It's kind of...

00:15:47.890 --> 00:15:49.480
That's not it!

00:15:49.480 --> 00:15:51.780
rambunctious on the bridge over there.

00:15:52.280 --> 00:15:54.040
By the way, are you all right?

00:15:54.040 --> 00:15:57.930
Don't you feel lethargic or suddenly disheartened?

00:15:57.930 --> 00:15:59.730
That's an unusual question.

00:15:58.580 --> 00:16:04.510
You shouldn't look away when you're riding a bike.

00:15:59.730 --> 00:16:02.550
I'm fine! I'm pretty capable despite my looks.

00:16:02.550 --> 00:16:05.050
Fixing a broken sandal strap is a piece of cake!

00:16:05.050 --> 00:16:07.960
That's not what I'm worried about.

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:11.660
Oh, right! I'm Yuzu. What's your name?

00:16:08.590 --> 00:16:12.090
Also, using a cellphone when riding a vehicle is a no-no!

00:16:15.140 --> 00:16:16.340
Shamo.

00:16:16.340 --> 00:16:20.060
Shamo-chan, is it?
I'm so lucky today!

00:16:20.060 --> 00:16:24.460
I even got to save on groceries because
of Irageya's going out of business sale!

00:16:26.610 --> 00:16:30.410
Y-Yuzu, wait a second! This isn't what we agreed on!

00:16:30.410 --> 00:16:33.380
Shamo-chan, don't act so stubborn.

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:35.830
A girl shouldn't be covered in dust!

00:16:36.210 --> 00:16:38.340
If any gets in your eyes, I'm sorry.

00:16:38.340 --> 00:16:41.860
Fixing the sandal strap would've been enough.

00:16:41.860 --> 00:16:44.750
She is one unusual girl.

00:17:02.560 --> 00:17:05.410
This barley tea has sugar in it!

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:08.480
Nobody has treated me like a child in quite some time.

00:17:09.930 --> 00:17:10.960
Well...

00:17:12.060 --> 00:17:15.550
this isn't so bad I guess.

00:17:17.630 --> 00:17:20.100
She's already inside the town!

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:23.290
This is what happens when you depend
on a fancy gadget you can't even use!

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:24.650
Sorry!

00:17:24.650 --> 00:17:26.270
The Goddess of Poverty is in Mayu-sama's house!

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:26.950
What?!

00:17:26.950 --> 00:17:28.290
Already in the house?

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:31.230
Yuzu-san is in danger. Hurry!

00:17:31.420 --> 00:17:33.760
We need to get there faster then!

00:17:33.760 --> 00:17:35.760
I'll use my powers to make us a shortcut!

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:37.290
Open the gate!

00:17:37.640 --> 00:17:40.190
Heed thine master and affix an impervious passage!

00:17:45.270 --> 00:17:46.240
Yuzu, are you all right?

00:17:46.240 --> 00:17:47.750
Yuzu-san, are you all right?!

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:49.800
Oh, everyone's here.

00:17:50.180 --> 00:17:51.310
Welcome!

00:17:52.510 --> 00:17:55.010
The situation is quite different than I imagined.

00:17:55.010 --> 00:17:55.820
Yes.

00:17:55.820 --> 00:18:00.230
Yuzu-san, do you feel depressed?
Did you drop your purse anywhere?

00:18:00.230 --> 00:18:01.770
Anything wrong like that?

00:18:01.770 --> 00:18:04.060
No, nothing that unusual.

00:18:02.280 --> 00:18:03.870
Shut your mouth, cretin.

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:07.580
Sukiyaki

00:18:04.190 --> 00:18:09.560
Yuzu, please tell me the dinner isn't eggs on rice instead of the sukiyaki.

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:13.810
A sorry feeling

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:14.140
Oh, I'm sorry, Mayu-sama. I'm actually
thinking of making an egg bowl for dinner.

00:18:14.140 --> 00:18:15.280
An egg bowl?

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:16.980
That's quite extravagant.

00:18:16.980 --> 00:18:18.150
It's great!

00:18:18.150 --> 00:18:20.110
They're already used to being poor!

00:18:18.150 --> 00:18:20.110
It's more appetizing than egg on rice!

00:18:20.110 --> 00:18:22.130
What should we do?

00:18:22.130 --> 00:18:23.200
Where's the Goddess of Poverty?

00:18:24.170 --> 00:18:27.690
It's because Mayu made Yuzu work too hard!

00:18:27.850 --> 00:18:30.860
Oh, I'll serve everyone tea.

00:18:30.860 --> 00:18:33.420
Yuzu-san, it's dangerous, please don't come any closer!

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:36.250
This girl might appear innocent at first glance,

00:18:36.250 --> 00:18:38.870
but she's actually the mighty Goddess of Poverty!

00:18:40.960 --> 00:18:43.380
Huh? Don't tell me...

00:18:43.610 --> 00:18:47.250
So, what's the plan now that she's made it this far into town?

00:18:47.250 --> 00:18:51.140
According to the guardian deity code,
since she didn't infiltrate the shrine

00:18:51.140 --> 00:18:53.810
that represents the spiritual center of this town; we're allowed to put up a fight.

00:18:54.480 --> 00:18:59.350
Furthermore, we normally have certain restrictions when using our divine power in this realm;

00:18:59.350 --> 00:19:02.770
however, given the special circumstances, we may attempt a direct confrontation using our abilities.

00:18:59.930 --> 00:19:02.780
Um, everyone, please listen...

00:19:02.980 --> 00:19:05.640
Hm, I wanted to avoid fighting if at all possible;

00:19:05.640 --> 00:19:09.280
but at this point, a direct confrontation is
necessary to drive out the Goddess of Poverty.

00:19:06.560 --> 00:19:08.280
Could you please listen? I'm talking here...

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:15.980
Hmph, as the granddaughter of the god of destruction, Daikokuten, I would actually prefer that!

00:19:15.980 --> 00:19:17.920
I agree with her.

00:19:18.230 --> 00:19:20.270
Did you hear that, Goddess of Poverty?

00:19:20.270 --> 00:19:23.580
As the guardian of this town, I challenge you to a duel!

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:23.910
Come out—

00:19:23.850 --> 00:19:25.280
I'm disappointed

00:19:23.910 --> 00:19:25.050
I'm disappointed in you!

00:19:27.700 --> 00:19:29.270
Y-Yuzu-san?

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:34.210
I've been listening to everything, and all you guys are doing is ganging up on her!

00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:37.000
I don't know if she's the Goddess of
Poverty or the Goddess of Disease,

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:39.690
but is this how the gods in this town treat others?!

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:41.990
Y-Yuzu-san, you see,

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:46.110
we aren't trying to drive her out because we're being mean.

00:19:46.110 --> 00:19:48.270
We're just following the rules for proper battle—

00:19:48.270 --> 00:19:49.450
Silence!

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:49.960
Yes, ma'am!

00:19:51.100 --> 00:19:51.970
Yuzu.

00:19:55.070 --> 00:19:56.270
Shamo-chan?

00:19:57.630 --> 00:20:02.010
As First-Class Inspector of the Property Department, the goddess Ame-no-Sagiri Shamou, I will now announce my decision!

00:20:04.980 --> 00:20:07.260
Kneel down and listen.

00:20:07.400 --> 00:20:11.230
After having carefully examined the scene in this town,

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:16.260
I must say the incompetence of you all was painful to watch.

00:20:16.390 --> 00:20:23.880
However, I learned through Yuzu here that
human kids living in this town are intelligent.

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:28.290
So, I've decided to acknowledge you for your effort!

00:20:28.900 --> 00:20:30.290
Thus, the verdict this time...

00:20:30.940 --> 00:20:31.840
is postponed!

00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:32.790
Yes, ma'am!

00:20:37.690 --> 00:20:39.070
Yaoyorozu-dou

00:20:39.620 --> 00:20:41.120
She left.

00:20:41.120 --> 00:20:41.740
Yes.

00:20:42.600 --> 00:20:47.030
She was a very powerful goddess, wasn't she?

00:20:47.030 --> 00:20:47.430
Mhm.

00:20:49.360 --> 00:20:50.420
Aye, Yuzu,

00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:53.810
sometimes misfortune simply cannot be avoided.

00:20:53.710 --> 00:20:58.960
Ira

00:20:54.270 --> 00:20:57.010
Like the expansions and recessions of the business cycle,

00:20:57.010 --> 00:20:59.070
like how life and death cannot be separated,

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:02.810
fortune and misfortune are simply indivisible and must coexist.

00:21:03.500 --> 00:21:06.960
Hence, where there is a god of poverty;
there must also be a god of wealth.

00:21:06.960 --> 00:21:09.330
It's a position no one seeks.

00:21:10.460 --> 00:21:13.330
Why did you bring the Goddess of Poverty home with you?

00:21:13.530 --> 00:21:17.480
She looked similar to you when we first met!

00:21:17.480 --> 00:21:21.680
R-Really? Was I that aloof and arrogant back then?

00:21:21.680 --> 00:21:22.590
Who knows?

00:21:22.600 --> 00:21:25.940
I think I've always been pretty honest and cheerful.

00:21:25.940 --> 00:21:27.830
I'm not sure about that.

00:21:28.100 --> 00:21:30.730
I'll go get dinner ready.

00:21:30.730 --> 00:21:31.870
Egg bowl, right?

00:21:31.870 --> 00:21:33.430
You have a package!

00:21:33.430 --> 00:21:34.740
I think that's for us.

00:21:34.740 --> 00:21:35.720
Coming!

00:21:35.720 --> 00:21:39.160
I'll play some video games before dinner then.

00:21:41.240 --> 00:21:44.030
Wait, didn't you leave for the next town?!

00:21:44.030 --> 00:21:46.860
I'll leave once I've beaten this game.

00:21:46.860 --> 00:21:48.530
Are you really fine with that?

00:21:48.530 --> 00:21:50.040
That tickles my stomach.

00:21:50.040 --> 00:21:52.740
Mayu-sama, Mayu-sama! Please come over here!

00:21:52.890 --> 00:21:53.720
Fragile

00:21:55.110 --> 00:21:56.120
It's huge!

00:22:02.140 --> 00:22:09.190
yukkuri nozokikonda ashita to iu mirai

00:22:02.140 --> 00:22:09.190
I gently peered into the future which we call tomorrow

00:22:09.190 --> 00:22:13.290
sakasama ni nagameta sekai

00:22:09.190 --> 00:22:13.290
Looking at the world upside down

00:22:13.320 --> 00:22:20.350
kirameku watagashigumo ni omoide wo utsushite

00:22:13.320 --> 00:22:20.350
I projected my memories upon the glittering cotton candy clouds

00:22:20.360 --> 00:22:24.460
nanairo no ribon wo kaketa

00:22:20.360 --> 00:22:24.460
And hung rainbow ribbons

00:22:24.480 --> 00:22:31.780
hitori ni naru to samishikute fukigen yo

00:22:24.480 --> 00:22:31.780
When I'm left alone, I feel lonely and depressed

00:22:32.190 --> 00:22:38.250
itsudatte koko ni ite

00:22:32.190 --> 00:22:38.250
So stay here forever

00:22:38.250 --> 00:22:43.490
dare ni demo kitto aru wa

00:22:38.250 --> 00:22:43.490
I'm sure everyone has some

00:22:43.490 --> 00:22:49.400
tojikometa negai no kakera

00:22:43.490 --> 00:22:49.400
Unfulfilled desires locked inside their hearts

00:22:49.400 --> 00:22:51.660
Baby! Oh My God!

00:22:51.660 --> 00:23:01.610
kienai chiisana omoi no kagi ni furete hoshii yeah

00:22:51.660 --> 00:23:01.610
I want you to realize the key is that small memory that won't disappear. Yeah

00:23:01.610 --> 00:23:08.080
yasashii kioku e to tsuredaseru no wa

00:23:01.610 --> 00:23:08.080
You're always the only one

00:23:08.080 --> 00:23:12.370
itsudatte kimi dake

00:23:08.080 --> 00:23:12.370
Who can make me reminisce fondly

00:23:11.610 --> 00:23:13.940
Baby! Oh My God!

00:23:13.170 --> 00:23:14.810
Hey Baby! Oh My God!

00:23:14.380 --> 00:23:16.590
Baby! Oh My God!

00:23:15.970 --> 00:23:17.520
Hey Baby! Oh My God!

00:23:17.160 --> 00:23:19.300
Baby! Oh My God!

00:23:18.750 --> 00:23:20.380
Hey Baby! Oh My God!

00:23:26.400 --> 00:23:41.370
Next Episode

00:23:27.170 --> 00:23:29.220
Yuzu, let's do the next episode preview.

00:23:29.220 --> 00:23:32.440
Mayu-sama, now's not the time to be so laid back!

00:23:32.440 --> 00:23:34.450
Please do something about this big box!

00:23:34.450 --> 00:23:36.220
This is huge! What's inside?

00:23:36.220 --> 00:23:38.870
If you don't, the dinner menu will be...

00:23:38.870 --> 00:23:41.150
What?! What about the egg bowl?!
